{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She gives Cato a kind smile then finishes her tea.","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:24:26.295000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T03:24:32.426000Z","id":"742221797319245922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Your hag *really* hated the knights. I am glad you are with us though. We need more compassion.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:25:43.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742222120494563358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"People keep telling me how awful she was.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:27:34.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742222587484176424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Mmm as far as hags go she wasn't so bad. She was just horrid compared to the real you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:28:11.758000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742222742979608667","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Believe me when I say. Wren's was far worse.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:28:28.364000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742222812630220861","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I did see that briefly before I was taken..\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:30:10.090000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742223239299989557","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"She uh. HATED me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:30:28.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742223315841581066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Yours was. Confident, strong willed, and caring. But all regarding the wrong things.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:31:05.025000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742223469713948743","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Some are better actors than others. Those Hags were awful not just to us captured it seems.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:32:07.375000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742223731228934205","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods.\"Do you, want to talk about what it was like? Trauma.... it sucks to hold in.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:32:58.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742223943603191850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Its blurry. I remember praying to the Raven Queen mostly. We  saw others too, they were taken away and never came back.\" Her face gets dark for a moment then softens again \"We were kept alive, we couldn't speak to each other, just watch. Thankfully we weren't physically tourtured.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:36:34.451000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742224851426738269","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods. \"You are stronger then I. I would have broken. Don't do well trapped. Did your god help?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:37:43.260000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742225140032602202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"The Raven Queen is complicated and difficult to understand. She never communicates directly. Before I was captured, I saw a raven feather fall from the sky. It meant something, a warning, to keep faith, it's hard to tell. But I knew if I wasn't going to come back I would be fine. I would likely visit the Fortress of Memories to serve her in death.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:41:55.551000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T03:42:23.954000Z","id":"742226198217752647","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Because of her, I'm not afraid of dying, but I do value my life.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:43:06.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742226497347125280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I don't think I am afraid of dying either. Just others dying.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T03:43:59.350000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742226717468262461","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
