{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"hmmm..... Its a job some of you have... where you build buildings\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T17:41:50.364000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742437569383628810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato shakes his head. \"They are a secret society living among us. They have many members. I wish I could tell you more. What are your morals Gil. Protect people? Save them? Make the hard decisions, for others?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T17:49:27.610000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742439487212355605","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"thinks long and hard of the question being asked","created_at":"2020-08-10T17:50:23.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742439721535406243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"at one point, it was serving my people.... this town... is my people.... I dont protect.... you all protect me.... for unknown reasons.... I dont save people.... otherwise I would have saved Amara.....\" he looks at the water flooding town \"If I saved people.... then I would remove their free will.... their choice to decide what battlefield to die on.... if I protected people..... I would be saying they are weaker than me.... and need my protection..... I follow the beating heart of the sea..... I help preserve life.... I give of my flesh and blood.... in service to others\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T17:56:19.838000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742441216221642823","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods taking it in. \"Would you stop people from sacrificing others, for their own desires? Protect people from evil, if they do not wish to face it? If Navar had wanted Amara, and she said no. Would you have stopped him?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:05:13.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742443454189010965","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I could not have stopped him....\" pauses to think \"I would find the people that could stop it.... but as for me.... how would you have me stop someone?  with my frail arms?  You have seen me in a fight.... I am only a target.... YOU stop evil..... I give you healing, and distractions\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:08:38.743000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742444315414102076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"against the hags..... all i could to was run... and even then... they immobilized me like a child....... I couldnt save a single person.... in the halls of grease..... all I was.... was something to be punched... and they wasted so much keeping me alive.....\" looks Cato dead in the eye \"how would you propose I stop anyone?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:10:41.221000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T18:13:52.745000Z","id":"742444829124067368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"With your words, your wisdom, your guidance. People believe in you. They trust you. Yes I can fight. I can kill, but that doesn't make people follow you. I wish I ould trade gifts Gil. Believe in yourself, I need you friend.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:15:07.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742445945559711815","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"It doesnt make me able to 'stop evil'.... I will aid those that fight evil.... But I have no ability to fight it myself.  Me being in a fight.... only raises the risks to everyone else being worried for my safety\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:16:57.337000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742446406668779680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"dont forget... when it mattered under the sea... talking to fishmother.... when i needed people to follow me... to listen.... you all turned your backs on my words..... and showed how much my wisdom matters when it counts\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:18:43.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742446853269749851","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I need you Gil. There are dangers ahead only you may help with. There is much you need to know that I cannot tell you. I ask you to speak with Florian, and become a knight. Not for selfish desires, but it is the only way for you to know the truth of what lies ahead. You don't need to fight, to lead others towards light. Please atleast converse with him. Tell him what I spoke to you about.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:23:03.213000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742447941263949934","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"When I asked your help the other night..... you weren't there for me.  I will hear him out.... but I wont join something I dont believe in\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:24:47.614000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742448379153350686","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
